tinyigrf code is an independent implementation, MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

The coefficient data in src/coefficients.h are extracted and reformatted from:
International Association of Geomagnetism and Aeronomy (IAGA), Working Group
V-MOD (2024), IGRF-14. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14012302
Official distribution: https://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/IAGA/vmod/coeffs/igrf14coeffs.txt

The IGRF-14 coefficient release is licensed Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: selected the 2025.0 main field and 2025-2030 secular-variation columns,
reformatted as constant C records, and retained all degrees through 13.
The data are scientific model coefficients, not newly authored TinyNadir code.
Retain this attribution and license reference when redistributing the data.
